---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import LongFormSection from '../../components/LongFormSection.astro';
import LinkCards from '../../components/LinkCards.astro';
import HowItWorks from '../../components/HowItWorks.astro';
import Faq from '../../components/Faq.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';
import { serviceIcon } from '../../components/icon-maps';
import { services, serviceUrl } from '../../data/services';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
import { faqSchema } from '../../lib/schema';
const f = site.facts;
const faqs = [
  { q: 'Do you repair washing machines at home?', a: 'Yes. All our repairs are done at your home. We only take a machine away in rare cases where a workshop repair is needed, and we will discuss that with you first.' },
  { q: 'Do you charge a call-out fee?', a: `The call-out fee is ${f.calloutFee}, ${f.calloutCondition}. You get a quote before any work starts.` },
  { q: 'Is the repair guaranteed?', a: `Yes. Repairs carry our ${f.warranty} warranty on parts and labour.` },
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Washing Machine Repair Services | ProServ"
  description={`Washing machine repair services at your home: front and top loaders, washer-dryers, installation, servicing and parts. Call ${site.phone.display}.`}
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Services', href: '/services/' }]}
  schema={[faqSchema(faqs)]}
>
  <PageHero
    h1="Washing machine repair services"
    eyebrow="What we do"
    intro={`<p>ProServ offers a full range of washing machine repair services, all done at your home. Whether you have a front loader, a top loader or a washer-dryer, our technician comes to you with the common parts on board, diagnoses the fault and gives you a clear quote before starting. We repair all major washing machine brands, and we'll always tell you honestly if a repair isn't worth it.</p>`}
  />
  <LinkCards alt eyebrow="What we repair" heading="Choose a service" headingId="svc-list" items={services.map((s) => ({ href: serviceUrl(s.slug), title: s.name, text: s.summary, icon: serviceIcon(s.slug) }))} />
  <LongFormSection reservedIds={['svc-list']}>
      <h2>Repairs for every type of washing machine</h2>
      <p>Most washing machines in South African homes are either front loaders or top loaders, and they fail in different ways. Front loaders pack a heavy drum, bearings, a door seal and a door lock into a sealed cabinet, so their typical faults are bearings, pumps, locks and seals. Top loaders tend to wear out their lid switches, drive couplings, gearboxes and suspension. Washer-dryers add a drying system with its own heater, fan and condenser. Our <a href="/services/front-loader-repairs/">front loader repairs</a>, <a href="/services/top-loader-repairs/">top loader repairs</a> and <a href="/services/washer-dryer-repairs/">washer dryer repairs</a> pages explain the common faults for each.</p>
      <h2>Not sure what's wrong?</h2>
      <p>That's fine. Tell us what the machine is doing, or browse our list of <a href="/problems/">common washing machine problems</a>: not draining, not spinning, leaking, not switching on, door problems, noise, error codes and filling faults. If there's a code on the display, our <a href="/error-codes/">error code guides</a> may explain it.</p>
      <h2>Keeping your machine going</h2>
      <p>A yearly <a href="/services/washing-machine-servicing/">service</a> catches worn hoses, blocked filters and noisy bearings before they turn into bigger repairs. If you've bought a new machine or are moving house, our <a href="/services/washing-machine-installation/">installation and plumbing-in</a> service gets it connected, levelled and tested properly. And when a part has failed, we supply and fit it through our <a href="/services/washing-machine-parts-replacement/">parts replacement</a> service.</p>
      <h2>Pricing</h2>
      <p>Every job is quoted after diagnosis, before work starts. See <a href="/washing-machine-repair-cost/">washing machine repair cost</a> for what affects the price, and <a href="/repair-or-replace/">repair or replace</a> if your machine is getting on.</p>
  </LongFormSection>
  <HowItWorks tone="surface" />
  <Faq items={faqs} tone="white" />
  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
